-----------------------------------------------------

Added as a hard dependency for the COMBINE archive export. BSD-3-Clause
grants use, modification and redistribution with the notice retained, so it
sits under Apache-2.0 without the separation stdpopsim needed.

**This is the one entry in this file not read from a shipped licence file.**
The package is not installed in the environment where this audit was run, so
its licence was taken from the package index rather than from the document
that travels with the code. Every other entry here was read from the
distribution itself, which is the rule this project set for exactly this
reason: an index summary and a shipped LICENSE do not always agree.

Re-verify on a machine where it is installed and delete this paragraph.
Recording the weaker basis is the point — a compliance record that does not
