TERRIUM IS NOT TELLURIUM

Tellurium is a separate, established systems-biology environment from the
same lab. Terrium is unaffiliated with it, is not a fork of it, and does not
depend on the `tellurium` package -- a prohibition made executable by
Constitution Rule 7 and scripts/check_forbidden_packages.py.

Terrium is a consumer of libRoadRunner and Antimony, in the ordinary way
those libraries are meant to be consumed. The similar name is a mistake and
is addressed in README.md and docs/RENAME_PLAN.md.

